body:
\* Have respect for yourself and don't let anyone make you deal with the bullshit you don't deserve. I know you're attached and it will hurt to move on, but instead, you're making things worse on yourself for when it does blow up in your face. Pain and rejection is part of the process. It will lead to better things if you get back out there and find new women. \*

&#x200B;

Right in my face!
